---
---

<section data-reveal class="border-b border-[#e8dcce]/12 bg-[#141210] py-16 sm:py-20 lg:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1360px] px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-12">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <h2 class="font-display text-[clamp(2.25rem,4.8vw,3.75rem)] font-bold uppercase leading-[1.02] text-[#f3efe9]">
        BUKAN SEKADAR <span class="text-[#e87161]">KELAS NGONTEN</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[16px] sm:text-[18px] leading-relaxed text-[#b5aea4]">
        Kami membimbing Anda dari pembuatan konten pertama hingga monetisasi produk digital. Metode yang sama telah konsisten mendampingi ribuan anggota Akademi Creator sejak 2019.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 lg:grid-cols-12">
      <article class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-[#e8dcce]/18 bg-[#181614] p-6 sm:p-9">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#e8dcce]/12 pb-4 num-tabular">
            <span class="font-display text-[22px] font-bold text-[#e87161]">01</span>
            <span class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#9e968c]">Fondasi Retensi &amp; Pertumbuhan</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-[30px] sm:text-[36px] font-bold uppercase leading-[1.08] text-[#f3efe9]">
            100K Followers Pertama Berbasis Perilaku Manusia
          </h3>
          <p class="max-w-[58ch] text-[15px] sm:text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#e8e2da]">
            Pelajari perilaku manusianya, bukan sekadar mengejar algoritmanya. Algoritma media sosial berganti setiap beberapa bulan, tetapi cara kerja otak manusia merespons rasa penasaran dan emosi tetap sama sejak zaman purba.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-[#e8dcce]/16 bg-[#121110] p-4 sm:p-6">
          <div class="mb-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-[#e8dcce]/10 pb-3.5 text-[12px]">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold text-[#f3efe9]">
              <span aria-hidden="true" class="h-2 w-4 rounded-sm bg-[#d65a4a]"></span>
              <span>Kurva Terstruktur 90 Hari (Target 100K)</span>
            </span>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[#b5aea4]">
              <span aria-hidden="true" class="h-0.5 w-4 bg-[#e8e2da]"></span>
              <span>Unggahan Tanpa Pola Retensi</span>
            </span>
          </div>

          <img
            src="/acre/value/card1.webp"
            alt="Grafik proyeksi pertumbuhan 0 ke 100K followers dalam 90 hari"
            width="708"
            height="444"
            loading="lazy"
            class="h-auto w-full object-contain brightness-110 contrast-105"
          />

          <div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-3 gap-2.5 border-t border-[#e8dcce]/10 pt-3.5 text-[12px] num-tabular">
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-[#e87161]">Hari 01 sampai 15</p>
              <p class="text-[#b5aea4]">Fast Track &amp; Riset Ceruk</p>
            </div>
            <div class="border-l border-[#e8dcce]/10 pl-3">
              <p class="font-semibold text-[#f3efe9]">Hari 16 sampai 60</p>
              <p class="text-[#b5aea4]">Validasi Hook &amp; Cerita</p>
            </div>
            <div class="border-l border-[#e8dcce]/10 pl-3">
              <p class="font-semibold text-[#f3efe9]">Hari 61 sampai 90</p>
              <p class="text-[#b5aea4]">Skala 100K &amp; Monetisasi</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col gap-6">
        <article class="flex-1 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-[#e8dcce]/16 bg-[#181614] p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#e8dcce]/12 pb-3 num-tabular">
              <span class="font-display text-[22px] font-bold text-[#e87161]">02</span>
              <span class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#9e968c]">Mesin Bisnis Digital</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-[26px] sm:text-[30px] font-bold uppercase leading-[1.1] text-[#f3efe9]">
              Fokus Monetisasi, Keluar dari Rat Race
            </h3>
            <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#b5aea4]">
              Jumlah pengikut besar tanpa sistem konversi tidak membayar tagihan. Anda dibimbing mengubah audiens menjadi pendapatan melalui produk digital, kelas online, skema webinar, dan kerja sama brand.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-5 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-[#e8dcce]/12 bg-[#171717] p-2">
            <img
              src="/acre/value/card2.webp"
              alt="Ilustrasi daya ungkit sistem monetisasi produk digital dibanding kerja manual berulang"
              width="420"
              height="420"
              loading="lazy"
              class="max-h-[236px] w-auto object-contain"
            />
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-[#e8dcce]/16 bg-[#181614] p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-5">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#e8dcce]/12 pb-3 num-tabular">
            <span class="font-display text-[22px] font-bold text-[#e87161]">03</span>
            <span class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#9e968c]">Pendampingan Pasca-Beli</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-[26px] sm:text-[30px] font-bold uppercase leading-[1.1] text-[#f3efe9]">
            Komunitas Satu Visi &amp; Ruang Diskusi Mentor
          </h3>
          <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#b5aea4]">
            Berjuang sendiri itu melelahkan. Di sini Anda bertumbuh bersama komunitas aktif sejak 2019 dilengkapi ruang diskusi privat 1-on-1 untuk membedah naskah dan evaluasi profil.
          </p>
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-[#e8dcce]/14 bg-[#121110] p-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <img
                src="/acre/mentors/ogut.webp"
                alt="Aldio Ogut"
                width="44"
                height="44"
                loading="lazy"
                class="h-11 w-11 shrink-0 rounded-full border border-[#e8dcce]/20 object-cover object-[58%_24%]"
              />
              <div class="min-w-0">
                <p class="text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#f3efe9]">Aldio Ogut · Ruang Diskusi 1-on-1</p>
                <p class="text-[12px] text-[#9e968c] truncate">"Kirim draf 3 detik pembukamu di sini untuk kita bedah."</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <a
              href="/dashboard/chat"
              class="mt-3.5 inline-flex min-h-[44px] w-full items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-[#736b63] bg-[#181614] px-4 text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#f3efe9] hover:border-[#a89f95] transition-colors"
            >
              Lihat Simulasi Ruang Diskusi Mentor
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
